{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ProcW is a up to 4-Player Local Multiplayer game. At the end of every round, the loser's weapon stats get changed randomly, whilst the winner gets points.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lua Version:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently has the following features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Player Local PVP Mode (1 Keyboard &amp; Mouse, 1 Controller)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay Impacting Settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly changing weapon stats at the end of each round, allowing infinite replayability.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Godot Version:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 player local PVP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay impacting Settings (Ice skating mode, Shop every five rounds, etc.)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Toggleable] Randomly changing weapon stats at the end of each round, allowing infinite replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much more stability than the Lua version.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727880?t=1755819271","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727880/6bd38f771176d596db9e05c1f520a55203e154af/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755819271","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727880/81040472c8594db299bd3ec6ec9fc6e65ee1636e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755819271","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727880/81040472c8594db299bd3ec6ec9fc6e65ee1636e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755819271","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ProcW is a up to 4-Player Local Multiplayer game. At the end of every round, the loser's weapon stats get changed randomly, whilst the winner gets points.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lua Version:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently has the following features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Player Local PVP Mode (1 Keyboard &amp; Mouse, 1 Controller)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay Impacting Settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly changing weapon stats at the end of each round, allowing infinite replayability.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Godot Version:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 player local PVP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay impacting Settings (Ice skating mode, Shop every five rounds, etc.)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Toggleable] Randomly changing weapon stats at the end of each round, allowing infinite replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much more stability than the Lua version.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Pk"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727880/c1e6b1b09af2652f6f117d225ba28d711780eac4/header.jpg?t=1755819271","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3727880/420709747/53fb0c8cfc7d8ae32f2b187c44a058648cd2fb63/1750628555/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750955492","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor